OL,3,GNEWSALeaders frustrated by council
OL,4,Ashake-up delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitical leaders have expressed
OL,7,Ffrustration after a planned major
OL,8,Fshake-up of local government was pushed
OL,9,Fback.
OL,11,FLancashire had been set to undergo
OL,12,Flocal government reorganisation, which
OL,13,Fwould have seen the county council and
OL,14,F14 district councils and unitary
OL,15,Fauthorities replaced with four new
OL,16,Funitaries.
OL,18,FBut the planned reforms - which would
OL,19,Fhave impacted 14 areas across England -
OL,20,Fwere put on hold by the government in
OL,21,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
