OL,3,GNEWSALeaders frustrated by council
OL,4,Ashake-up delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal Government Minister Jim McMahon
OL,7,Fconfirmed that only five of the
OL,8,Foriginal proposals would go ahead as
OL,9,Fplanned - Lancashire not being one of
OL,10,Fthem.
